[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛洗完澡，<br>独自来到中庭。|#0102Adv15_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呼……|#0102Adv15_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:夜晚的冷风吹拂，带走身体上冒出的热气。|#0102Adv15_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明天我们就要逃出这里了……<br>　大家已经付出这么多的努力，一定要成功）|#0102Adv15_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被四面墙壁划成方形的夜空中，有几颗星星在闪烁。|#0102Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（好想快点见到爸爸妈妈啊）|#0102Adv15_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在回去上学应该还来得及。<br>　我已经下定决心要重新开始的——）|#0102Adv15_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，这不是小艾吗……？|#0102Adv15_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一直在仰望夜空，<br>直到米莉亚叫她，她才反应过来。|#0102Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚走进中庭，<br>来到艾玛身边。|#0102Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你也睡不着呀……？|#0102Adv15_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，感觉心情好激动。|#0102Adv15_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我也是。哈哈，感觉就像旅游的前一天晚上一样兴奋。|#0102Adv15_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我说，米莉亚，<br>你到底经历了什么事？|#0102Adv15_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么会交换身体——|#0102Adv15_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在只有她和米莉亚两人，<br>于是艾玛便直截了当地问道。|#0102Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（前几天问她的时候被她岔开了话题，<br>　但我还是想了解清楚）|#0102Adv15_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我实在不觉得奈叶香所说的是<br>　全部的真相……）|#0102Adv15_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚有些为难地皱起眉。|#0102Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……真头疼啊，<br>大叔我不是很想说自己的事。|#0102Adv15_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯，这我多少能感觉到。|#0102Adv15_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但事实上也确实因为我没讲清楚，造成了很大误会。<br>所以，我很讨厌这样的自己。|#0102Adv15_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（原来米莉亚不喜欢自己吗……？）|#0102Adv15_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:小艾你真是个好孩子。<br>你一直那么努力，真的很了不起。|#0102Adv15_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，怎、怎么突然夸我！？<br>我、我没有很了不起啦……！？|#0102Adv15_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到艾玛脸红的样子，米莉亚微微一笑。|#0102Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我心想，一定要帮你们顺利回家。<br>……可说实话，我自己倒有点不想回去。|#0102Adv15_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（不想回去……？）|#0102Adv15_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是我不敢去面对现实……面对自己吧。|#0102Adv15_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚像是下定决心般叹了口气，<br>然后慢慢开始诉说。|#0102Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:220_2

[PrintTextModified Text:这是大叔我认识的一个少女的故事……|#0102Adv15_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在的年轻人<br>不都是把手机当成一切嘛。|#0102Adv15_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是有这样的人没错……|#0102Adv15_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.8 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:220_2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"那个少女也不例外，她很爱玩<ruby=\"SNS\">社交媒体</ruby>。<br>手机就好像是她的全世界。|#0102Adv15_Miria011|" AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当时呢，流行一种惩罚游戏，<br>就是和朋友小团体<br>互相拍一些见不得人的照片。|#0102Adv15_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而她被小团体出卖了，<br>自己拍的那些不雅照被传到了SNS上。|#0102Adv15_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不仅如此，小团体的朋友还嘲笑她。<br>把她当作玩具，拿她当乐子。|#0102Adv15_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好过分……|#0102Adv15_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过这只是大叔我认识的人的故事，<br>和我无关啦。|#0102Adv15_Miria015| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当时那个少女绝望得想要自杀。<br>然后大叔我就——|#0102Adv15_Miria016| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills,Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚说到这里就停住了。|#0102Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的脸色暗了下来，<br>只有嘴里在嘟哝着什么。|#0102Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆暗いトーンで

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是发生在我身上的事。|#0102Adv15_Miria017| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她仿佛在抵抗，抵抗着不容触及的禁忌——|#0102Adv15_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我要回房间啦。|#0102Adv15_Miria018| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Miria Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚逃也似的离开了这里。|#0102Adv15_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果刚刚那个故事的主角是米莉亚的话，<br>　那大叔岂不是当时救了她……）|#0102Adv15_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛隐约有这种预感，<br>但她想问的人已经不在了。|#0102Adv15_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

